cff-version: 1.2.0
title: godot-sandbox
message: >-
  The RISC-V sandbox module of the Godot fork (libriscv underneath, vendored in
  thirdparty/libriscv), supplied to entities-godot-sandbox through the goal
  manifest rather than vendored. It hosts the FBD guests, the export guests and
  the godot-vrm ELF.
